WEBVTT

NOTE
D-District Prison in motion. The walking prison strides across the desert on its massive drill legs, churning sand and dust.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Looking down from the prison. A drill leg grinds into the sand below, kicking up dust.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Support beams and cables sway as the prison strides forward, desert stretching beneath it.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:30.000
The drill legs descend through clouds of dust, the prison marching across the wasteland.
